&lt;p&gt;Before becoming a scientist, I was a musician and composer. I have a deep belief in science and art as sister endeavours — my scientific perspective is influenced by music and vice-versa. I like to make music in my free time. Here are some of my original compositions and recordings by other artists.&lt;/p&gt;
